// ---- Original-Code (muse-code/local-share-muse/sessions/2026/10/29/01a18967-8f34-75e3-bd91-9db28a27fadd/tool-outputs/01a18976-7f38-7420-80de-d8ed9ce13f83/call_01a189764e5072c5a6bfca305f3b535a-tool_patch.json), unveraendert, als Inline-Doku ----
// {"files":[{"path":"\\\\?\\C:\\Users\\danie\\OneDrive\\github-repos\\Agentenplattform\\apps\\backend\\app\\services\\quellen.py","hunks":[{"oldStart":1,"oldLines":0,"newStart":1,"newLines":73,"lines":["+\"\"\"Markt-Quellenadapter: Demo-Adapter + generischer RSS-Import.","+","+Regeln: keine Anmeldeschranken/CAPTCHAs umgehen; nur zulässige, frei","+abrufbare Quellen. Jeder Import ist dedupliziert, gerankt und mit","+Abrufzeit + Quelle protokolliert.","+\"\"\"","+from __future__ import annotations","+import re","+import xml.etree.ElementTree as ET","+from datetime import datetime","+from sqlalchemy.orm import Session","+from app.db import models","+from app.services.markt import ist_duplikat, ranking","+from app.tools.registry import ssrf_geprueft","+from app.core.logging import get_logger","+","+log = get_logger(\"quellen\")","+","+def demo_inserate(profil_name: str) -> list[dict]:","+    \"\"\"Klar gekennzeichnete Beispiel-Daten (keine echten Abrufe).\"\"\"","+    return [","+        {\"titel\": f\"[Demo] 2-Zimmer-Wohnung ({profil_name})\", \"preis\": 650.0,","+         \"url\": \"https://beispiel.invalid/demo-wohnung-1\"},","+        {\"titel\": f\"[Demo] 3-Zimmer-Wohnung ({profil_name})\", \"preis\": 890.0,","+         \"url\": \"https://beispiel.invalid/demo-wohnung-2\"},","+    ]","+","+def rss_importieren(feed_url: str, max_eintraege: int = 20) -> list[dict]:","+    \"\"\"Holt einen öffentlichen RSS/Atom-Feed (SSRF-geprüft).\"\"\"","+    if not ssrf_geprueft(feed_url):","+        raise ValueError(\"Feed-URL blockiert (SSRF-Schutz)\")","+    import urllib.request","+    req = urllib.request.Request(feed_url, headers={\"User-Agent\": \"Agentenplattform/1.0\"})","+    with urllib.request.urlopen(req, timeout=20) as r:  # noqa: S310 – URL ist geprüft","+        roh = r.read(512 * 1024)  # Größenlimit 512 KB","+    wurzel = ET.fromstring(roh)","+    eintraege = []","+    for item in list(wurzel.iter(\"item\"))[:max_eintraege] + list(wurzel.iter(\"{http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom}entry\"))[:max_eintraege]:","+        titel = (item.findtext(\"title\") or item.findtext(\"{http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom}title\") or \"\").strip()","+        link = (item.findtext(\"link\") or \"\").strip()","+        if not link:","+            link_el = item.find(\"{http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom}link\")","+            if link_el is not None: link = (link_el.get(\"href\") or \"\").strip()","+        beschreibung = (item.findtext(\"description\") or item.findtext(\"{http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom}summary\") or \"\")","+        preis = _preis_aus_text(titel + \" \" + beschreibung)","+        if titel and link: eintraege.append({\"titel\": titel, \"preis\": preis, \"url\": link})","+    return eintraege","+","+def _preis_aus_text(text: str) -> float | None:","+    m = re.search(r\"(\\d[\\d\\s.]*)\\s*€\", text)","+    if not m: return None","+    try: return float(m.group(1).replace(\".\", \"\").replace(\" \", \"\"))","+    except ValueError: return None","+","+def import_lauf(profil_id: str, max_preis: float, db: Session,","+               quelle: str = \"demo\", feed_url: str = \"\") -> dict:","+    \"\"\"Importiert Inserate eines Profils, dedupliziert, rankt. Idempotent via URL.\"\"\"","+    roh = demo_inserate(profil_id) if quelle == \"demo\" else rss_importieren(feed_url)","+    neu, doppelt = 0, 0","+    vorhanden = {l.url for l in db.query(models.Listing).filter_by(profil_id=profil_id).all()}","+    for e in roh:","+        if any(ist_duplikat(e[\"url\"], v) for v in vorhanden):","+            doppelt += 1; continue","+        db.add(models.Listing(profil_id=profil_id, titel=e[\"titel\"][:300],","+                              preis=e[\"preis\"], url=e[\"url\"][:500],","+                              ranking=ranking(e[\"preis\"], max_preis)))","+        vorhanden.add(e[\"url\"]); neu += 1","+    db.add(models.Event(type=\"market.listing_found\", source=f\"quellen:{quelle}\",","+                        ref_id=profil_id,","+                        payload={\"neu\": neu, \"doppelt\": doppelt}))","+    db.commit()","+    log.info(f\"Import {profil_id}: {neu} neu, {doppelt} doppelt\")","+    return {\"neu\": neu, \"doppelt\": doppelt, \"quelle\": quelle}"]}]}]}
